  "title": "Joseph Sikora & Gianni Paolo End Their Beef",
  "htmlContent": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":520367,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/45219c23c96470a89595ebb9243bf9b0-2.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-520367\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Getty Images </figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The conflict began when 50 Cent took the scene for the theme song Power during Tycoon Weekend. The actors of Power came onto the stage during the performance. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Most members of Power Cast welcomed Paolo onstage, with the exception of Sikora. On the camera, Tommy's actor pushes Paolo's hand when he attempts to dap him up.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/highrolla_/status/1563928015683424257?s=20u0026t=4hKcVQ7FwJr9OWGSXIFaQw\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/highrolla_/status/1563928015683424257?s=20&amp;t=4hKcVQ7FwJr9OWGSXIFaQw\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Power of Paolo: Ghost co-wstar Michael Rainey Jr. disclosed that the beef was finished while teasing their next episode of The Crew Has It Podcast.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/p/ClzIULHs1t1/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"instagram\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-instagram wp-block-embed-instagram\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/ClzIULHs1t1/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/p/ClzFo9kPFAp/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"instagram\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-instagram wp-block-embed-instagram\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/ClzFo9kPFAp/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“You pressed? I would be too,” Gianni had said- “some ppl just insecure [shrugging and crying emoji].”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>He continued in an Instagram Story, “[I’ve] shown nothing but love for the people before me. I respect 50 way too much to do that.”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Gianni then shared a screenshot of a comment where Joseph seemed to overshadow it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“Listen I was gonna leave this s**t alone but ppl Keep sending me this and this dude just straight up telling lies. It’s not ‘all good’, I asked him in the elevator what his deal was with me cause he’s been doing this sit for years when I’ve shown nothing but respect and love .. he kept just saying he doesn’t f**k with me. Nothing was resolved. Stop spreading lies cause people are pressing you about your saltiness,” he said.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Ch8DPPuudES/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"instagram\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-instagram wp-block-embed-instagram\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/Ch8DPPuudES/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->",
